5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4059-0
00:25:43.956 --> 00:25:45.036
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>No vidíš to no.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4119-1
00:25:44.715 --> 00:25:47.823
