5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4250-0
00:26:46.376 --> 00:26:47.336
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Radši bych si to evidoval.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4253-0
00:26:48.566 --> 00:26:48.926
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Dobře.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4254-0
00:26:48.916 --> 00:26:49.356
