5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4590-0
00:28:49.036 --> 00:28:49.476
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Úlet.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4621-0
00:28:49.056 --> 00:28:52.345
