5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4746-1
00:29:40.865 --> 00:29:43.166
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>jestli byste napsal ten status tady?</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/4749-0
