5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/5442-0
00:34:16.986 --> 00:34:17.306
<v Tom&#225;š Lanzend&#246;rfer>Poprvé.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/5477-0
00:34:17.116 --> 00:34:19.836
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>No,
