<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>jak to máte namyšlený, jo?</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9817-0
01:01:17.956 --> 01:01:18.236
<v Michael Gottwald>Jo.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9819-0
01:01:19.396 --> 01:01:19.996
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Super.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9826-0
