<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>OK no tak jo.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9884-0
01:01:45.076 --> 01:01:45.356
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Jo.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9886-0
01:01:45.426 --> 01:01:45.986
<v Michael Gottwald>Na závěr?</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9888-0
01:01:47.876 --> 01:01:48.276
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Super.</v>

5e65be76-2ae4-4e08-a01b-993579357505/9896-0
